  "period_note": "Solo basis. Own contemporaneous annual report: Balance Sheet and Profit and Loss Account (Solo, Taka precise) plus Note 7.09-7.12 (loan classification, provisioning). CORRECTIONS: the FY2016 report's later 'Five Years Performance' table's FY2014 column contains two figures that do not reconcile with its own other rows in the same table (Net Non-interest income 374.32 - Non-interest expenses 398.44 = -24.12, not Profit before provision and tax; and Profit before provision and tax 232.70 - Provision 153.79 = 78.91 =~ PBT, coincidentally close but Non-interest expenses/Profit-before-provision themselves are inconsistent with Net-interest-income + Net-non-interest-income). Rederiving from FY2014's own contemporaneous P&L (Total operating income 6,311,347,318 - Total operating expenses 3,784,375,001 = Profit before provision 2,526,972,317) gives Non-interest expenses = 378.44 crore (not 398.44), Profit before provision and tax = 252.70 crore (not 232.70), and Provision for loans and others = 173.79 crore (not 153.79) - now fully self-consistent: -121.62 + 374.32 = 252.70; 252.70 - 173.79 = 78.91 =~ 78.90 = reported PBT. The three corrected figures are used here; the FY2016 report's erroneous originals are recorded in this note for the record. All other balance-sheet rows in the FY2016 report's FY2014 column reproduce FY2014's own report exactly.",
